```

### 3. **Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) (OWASP A03:2021 - Injection)**

```javascript
// Insecure: Rendering user input without escaping
app.get('/profile', (req, res) => {
  const username = req.query.name;
  res.send(`<html><body>Hello ${username}</body></html>`); // XSS risk
});

// Secure: Escape user input or use template engines with auto-escaping
app.get('/profile', (req, res) => {
