### 🔒 **Authentication & Authorization**

The application uses **Clerk authentication** fairly well implemented:

**Strengths:**
- Uses JWT token verification for dashboard endpoints
- Implements role-based access control (admin vs. regular user)
- Hard-coded admin list (no env var override - good security practice)
- Session isolation (users only see their own sessions by default)

